hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"25","[AI-translation] Allah ke naam se; main ne Allah par bharosa kiya; Allah ke baghair koi taqat-quvvat nahin. [Ghar se nikalte waqt kahe]"
"26","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main gumrah hone ya gumrah kiye jaane, phisalne ya phislae jaane, zulm karne ya zulm sehne, jihalat karne ya mere sath jihalat kiye jaane se teri panah chahta hun."
